# Runtime artifacts and sensitive data
uploads/documents/*
!uploads/documents/.gitkeep
uploads/reports/*
!uploads/reports/.gitkeep
datasets/raw/*
!datasets/raw/.gitkeep
datasets/processed/*
!datasets/processed/.gitkeep
models/active/*
!models/active/.gitkeep
models/archive/*
!models/archive/.gitkeep
*.joblib
*.pkl
# Must sit AFTER the blanket *.joblib above — git applies the last matching
# rule, so an earlier negation would be silently overridden.
#
# The active attrition bundle is committed (20 KB) so the free-tier lite image
# can bake it in: Render builds from git and a free service gets no persistent
# disk to hold a trained artifact. Trained on the public IBM HR attrition
# dataset; the file holds model parameters, not employee records. A retrained
# bundle must be committed too, or the deployed service keeps serving the old
# one. See the root Dockerfile (AI service, lite build).
!models/active/attrition_model.joblib
!ai-service/models/active/attrition_model.joblib
*.log
logs/
chroma_data/
chroma_db/
uploads/attachments/*
!uploads/attachments/.gitkeep
uploads/profile-pictures/*
!uploads/profile-pictures/.gitkeep

# Tooling and operating system files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/

.vercel
.env*
!.env.example
!production.env.example
